Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some barcode bars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,are longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.03,0:00:03.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,and\Nthat's deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:04.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,They hold no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,number at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:07.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,On a UPC barcode,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:07.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,middle and end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:10.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard\Nbars extend lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,They\Nencode no digit;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,they split the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,code\Ninto two halves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:16.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,IBM's George Laurer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,was assigned to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,design a supermarket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,scanner label.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,His team defined
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:21.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard bars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:22.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,so a scanner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,could\Ndetect the label.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:24.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,They even told
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,it which half
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,it was reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:27.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the longest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,bars are signposts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:29.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,not data.
